Flask vs Django vs FastAPI

| Feature                         | 🪶 Flask                            | 🏢 Django                       | ⚡ FastAPI                        |
| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| **Type**                        | Lightweight Python web framework    | Full-stack Python web framework | Modern Python API framework      |
| **Main purpose**                | Websites, web apps, APIs            | Complete web applications       | APIs and AI backend services     |
| **Easy for beginners**          | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                               | ⭐⭐⭐                             | ⭐⭐⭐⭐                             |
| **Speed**                       | Fast                                | Good                            | Very fast                        |
| **Built-in Admin Panel**        | ❌ No                                | ✅ Yes                           | ❌ No                             |
| **Database ORM**                | Optional                            | ✅ Built-in                      | Optional                         |
| **Authentication**              | Add separately                      | ✅ Built-in support              | Add separately                   |
| **API Development**             | Good                                | Good                            | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent                  |
| **AI / ML Projects**            | ⭐⭐⭐⭐                                | ⭐⭐⭐⭐                            | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                            |
| **Large Applications**          | Possible, but requires more setup   | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent                 | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ for API-based architecture |
| **Flexibility**                 | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                               | ⭐⭐⭐                             | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                            |
| **Automatic API Documentation** | ❌ No                                | ❌ Not by default                | ✅ Yes                            |
| **Best for**                    | Simple/custom websites and web apps | Complete management systems     | AI apps, APIs, microservices     |


