=======

or your projects
Restaurant Ordering Project → Flask 🪶
College Management System → Django 🏢
College AI Assistant → FastAPI ⚡

So, your current College AI Assistant using FastAPI is a suitable choice because its main job is to connect the web interface with your AI model and return intelligent responses.

FastAPI fits your current assistant because it focuses on APIs, while Flask and Django become stronger choices when the application needs 
a full website backend or built-in management features rather than mainly AI requests.

